[{:db/id "q-77771/selection/6b39b9531dcc1c866ab859fb91b9652491088215652c766aa4b9f7f49c0f2f0a" :answer/id #uuid "e371970f-3e17-581f-b25c-f6e3bcb847e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-2y+8=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-77771/selection/acbcc3f8f16ed612f305978d42dfc7f71e32fc9b9724e59f5daba57a1f44e483" :answer/id #uuid "40fb94b5-44a5-5316-b2a1-4ce061ea5466" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x+5y+18=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-77771/selection/92d88f0763b570a4d850a648ab7d0e406ac76cfa0063912686f05f7ea91fca31" :answer/id #uuid "2a332799-bf6f-5f8e-a569-4d3d92f6125e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-4y+18=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-77771/selection/104d44f5b7bc610ea8f541998a9bea7f120083ac4df15100601fa997efd79b7c" :answer/id #uuid "fcc10ca3-1af7-50c4-b3f7-a50aa55766ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x-5y+18=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-77771/selection/1329f17890b30ad13533f97a9c9bab449b664eef424d3a1c3295536c9ba8a20c" :answer/id #uuid "31c67c8a-3dce-55e1-95fb-f6640a6a437d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x+2y+18=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-77771/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7ca0d668-1b87-5b28-9a5a-0445ee3ebc5d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-77771/selection/92d88f0763b570a4d850a648ab7d0e406ac76cfa0063912686f05f7ea91fca31" :answer-field/choices ["q-77771/selection/6b39b9531dcc1c866ab859fb91b9652491088215652c766aa4b9f7f49c0f2f0a" "q-77771/selection/acbcc3f8f16ed612f305978d42dfc7f71e32fc9b9724e59f5daba57a1f44e483" "q-77771/selection/92d88f0763b570a4d850a648ab7d0e406ac76cfa0063912686f05f7ea91fca31" "q-77771/selection/104d44f5b7bc610ea8f541998a9bea7f120083ac4df15100601fa997efd79b7c" "q-77771/selection/1329f17890b30ad13533f97a9c9bab449b664eef424d3a1c3295536c9ba8a20c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-77771" :question/id #uuid "9c181e4f-0f89-544f-856a-3ad22207819d" :question/math-academy-id "q-77771" :question/problem "Consider the line $y=-2x+3$ and linear transformation $T$ with matrix representation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat is the equation of the image of the line under the action of $T?$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the line $y=-2x+3$ passes through the points $U(0,3)$ and $V(1,1)$ since the coordinates of both points satisfy the equation.\n\nTo find the image of $U$ and $V$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing the coordinates of the points:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective image points are ${U}^{′}(-6,-3)$ and ${V}^{′}(-2,2).$\n\nFinally, we write the equation of the line that passes through ${U}^{′}$ and ${V}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =\\frac{{y}_{2}-{y}_{1}}{{x}_{2}-{x}_{1}}(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-(-3) & =\\frac{2-(-3)}{-2-(-6)}(x-(-6)) \\\\ y+3 & =\\frac{5}{4}(x+6) \\\\ 4y+12 & =5x+30 \\\\ 5x-4y+18 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-77771/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0c8f0fa1-a86a-577f-bdc9-fc7427faa18d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-77771"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-281121/field-1/59602bb452195bdf04abce5a0657b8e4ca549941503c2443c1b81080e7f8e349" :answer/id #uuid "d9453693-2f6b-53df-b1b7-0d188b90f75c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+5y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-281121/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "26a17d43-112b-5745-a663-0ba1628c09f4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-281121/field-1/59602bb452195bdf04abce5a0657b8e4ca549941503c2443c1b81080e7f8e349" :answer-field/choices ["q-281121/field-1/59602bb452195bdf04abce5a0657b8e4ca549941503c2443c1b81080e7f8e349"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-281121" :question/id #uuid "f75b74c5-e95f-51fa-9efd-e0ac511581a1" :question/math-academy-id "q-281121" :question/problem "Consider the line $y=2x+1$ and linear transformation $T$ with matrix representation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn **standard form**, the equation of the image of the line under the action of $T$ is\n\n{{field-1}}$=-3.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the line $y=2x+1$ passes through the points $A(0,1)$ and $B(1,3)$ since the coordinates of both points satisfy the equation.\n\nTo find the image of $A$ and $B$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing the coordinates of the points:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective image points are ${A}^{′}(2,-1)$ and ${B}^{′}(7,-2).$\n\nNow, we write the equation of the line that passes through ${A}^{′}$ and ${B}^{′}$ in point-slope form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =\\frac{{y}_{2}-{y}_{1}}{{x}_{2}-{x}_{1}}(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y+1 & =\\frac{-2+1}{7-2}(x-2) \\\\ y+1 & =-\\frac{1}{5}(x-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we transform the equation of the line to standard form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y+1 & =-\\frac{1}{5}(x-2) \\\\ 5y+5 & =-x+2 \\\\ x+5y & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-281121/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0c8f0fa1-a86a-577f-bdc9-fc7427faa18d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-281121"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-281581/field-1/6314377cd721220fbff59f198e097b4688596d74cf6ee593e9c6f7dd6fcd03c3" :answer/id #uuid "7573ae91-a983-5b17-bc51-6ecefd2f108b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+2y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186283254 :answer-field/choices ["q-281581/field-1/6314377cd721220fbff59f198e097b4688596d74cf6ee593e9c6f7dd6fcd03c3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}]
